00:11:52.870 --> 00:12:11.600
<v Harmon Leon>So the shooting was in a week. So I drove down from San Francisco to LA. I get out of my car. I go to the production office. And the first thing the producer says to me-- "you know, Harmon, we really can't mention the murders."
