00:39:57.360 --> 00:39:58.550
<v O.J. Simpson>Uh--
<v O.J. Simpson>呃——

00:39:58.550 --> 00:40:01.030
<v Tom Lange>And nobody's going to get hurt.
<v Tom Lange>没人会受伤。

00:40:01.030 --> 00:40:03.180
<v O.J. Simpson>I'm the only one that deserves it.
